      "trackName": "Dino Merge: Idle Clicker Game",
      "description": "A fun and easy idle clicker game for watch, tablet and phone. \n\nNo internet connection required for playing (play offline).\n\nClick on the boxes to get more dinos. Merge the dinos of the same size and color to get larger, more colorful dinos!\n\nFeatures:\n- Change background colors\n- Switch between dino and cactus characters\n- Save highscore\n- More games can be unlocked",
